## License exceptions

Runtime packages whose lock entry has no usable license field, with the license checked by hand:

- `limiter@1.1.5`: asserted MIT. lock has no license field; the package's own package.json uses the legacy \"licenses\": [{\"type\": \"MIT\"}]; via firebase-admin > jwks-rsa.

